Drop local packages here before build-iso.sh (gitignored binaries).
build-iso.sh stages these automatically when present:

  linux-appsynergy-*.pkg.tar.zst          (preferred kernel)
  linux-appsynergy-headers-*.pkg.tar.zst
  appsynergy-branding-*.pkg.tar.zst       (required offline after pacstrap)
  appsynergy-mirrorlist-*.pkg.tar.zst
  brave-bin-*.pkg.tar.zst
  thorium-browser-bin-*.pkg.tar.zst       (optional)

Legacy fallback: linux-cachyos-igpu{,-headers}-*.pkg.tar.zst

Published also at:
  https://git.appsynergy.io/api/packages/imabee/generic/appsynergy-repo/x86_64
